    "UIName": "Medusa 'Vordel'",
    "Id": "mechdef_medusa_MED-VD",
    "Name": "Medusa MED-VD",
    "Details": "This Medusa was named after a Wolfs Dragoons Honorname, being piloted by one of Said Dragoons. Outfitted with an array of Equipment to increase the Jump Distance to get easier into Close Range, An Upgraded Ewar package also helps with any Dezgra Stealth Units. Almost all of the Equipment on this Medusa was won by Trial of Possessions, from every Clan and House. Whilst being a 'Hand me Down', its also an Honour to Pilot the Mech, making the Pilots Ferocious in Battle and Inspiring Nearby Mechs. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Short</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_medusamech"
  },
